  {
   "title": "직접 눌러 보기: 이 단어는 어디를 볼까",
   "question": "예문에서 단어를 고르면 어떤 단어에 더 주목하는지 눈으로 볼 수 있나?",
   "shape": "움직이는 카드",
   "chart": null,
   "source": "ai",
   "size": "보통",
   "body": {
    "note": "예문에서 단어를 하나 고르면, 그 단어가 다른 단어들을 얼마나 보는지 진하기로 보여 줍니다. 진할수록 더 주목한다는 뜻입니다.",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>이 단어는 어디를 볼까</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}\nbody{font-family:'Pretendard','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#192d35}\nbutton,svg{font-family:inherit}\n.card{width:100vw;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(14px,3.6vw,28px);display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:8px}\nheader{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\n.kicker{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#698087;margin-bottom:7px;letter-spacing:.04em}\nh1{font-size:clamp(18px,3.4vw,25px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0}\n.readout{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0}\n.readout .label{font-size:11px;color:#64777d;margin-bottom:3px}\n.value{font-size:clamp(23px,4.6vw,34px);font-weight:800;color:#087b6a;line-height:1.12;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.example{font-size:10px;color:#73838a;margin-top:5px}\nmain{position:relative;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;font-size:11px;color:#53676e;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:3px}\n.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.swatch{width:13px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block}\n.selected-swatch{border:2px solid #7560bf;background:white}\n.attention-swatch{background:#4db79b}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:0;flex:1;overflow:hidden}\n.word{cursor:pointer;outline:none}\n.word .selection{fill:transparent;stroke:transparent;stroke-width:2}\n.word[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .selection{fill:#f6f3ff;stroke:#7560bf}\n.word:hover .selection{stroke:#a496ce}\n.word:focus-visible .selection{stroke:#51418f;stroke-width:3;stroke-dasharray:4 3}\n.ink{font-size:25px;font-weight:700;fill:#203c41;pointer-events:none}\n.weight{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;fill:#147b69;pointer-events:none;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.chosen{font-size:11px;fill:#7560bf;font-weight:700;pointer-events:none}\nfooter{flex-shrink:0}\n.guide{font-size:12px;color:#61777e;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}\n.guide::before{content:\"\";width:6px;height:6px;background:#7560bf;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}\n.meaning{border-top:1px solid #e4ebe9;padding-top:12px;font-size:clamp(12px,2.3vw,16px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.4}\n.meaning strong{color:#087b6a}\n@media(max-width:460px){\n.card{gap:5px}\nheader{gap:6px}\n.kicker{font-size:10px}\n.readout .label{font-size:10px}\n.example{max-width:112px;line-height:1.4;font-size:9px}\n.legend{font-size:10px;gap:12px}\n.guide{font-size:11px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.meaning{padding-top:9px}\n}\n@media(max-height:350px){\n.card{padding:12px;gap:2px}\n.kicker{margin-bottom:3px}\nh1{font-size:18px}\n.value{font-size:24px}\n.guide{margin-bottom:5px}\n.meaning{padding-top:6px;font-size:12px}\n.legend{padding:0}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article class=\"card\">\n<header>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"kicker\" id=\"figure\"></div>\n    <h1>이 단어는 어디를 볼까</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"readout\">\n    <div class=\"label\">가장 큰 주목 비중</div>\n    <div class=\"value\" id=\"peak\"></div>\n    <div class=\"example\">예시 값 · 실제 모델 측정 아님</div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main>\n  <div class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"색 안내\">\n    <span><i class=\"swatch selected-swatch\"></i>고른 단어</span>\n    <span><i class=\"swatch attention-swatch\"></i>진할수록 더 주목</span>\n  </div>\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 664 286\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"예문 메모장. 단어를 눌러 주목 비중을 비교하세요.\">\n    <defs>\n      <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-15%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"140%\">\n        <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"5\" flood-color=\"#25443a\" flood-opacity=\".08\"/>\n      </filter>\n    </defs>\n    <path d=\"M23 23 H619 L642 46 V261 H23 Z\" fill=\"#fffefa\" stroke=\"#e1e6dc\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M619 23 V46 H642\" fill=\"#f0f2e9\" stroke=\"#e1e6dc\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M66 24 V261\" stroke=\"#ecdcd9\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <path d=\"M24 91 H641 M24 169 H641 M24 217 H641\" stroke=\"#eaf0ea\"/>\n    <path d=\"M42 51 V24 Q42 12 51 12 Q60 12 60 24 V57 Q60 64 54 64 Q48 64 48 57 V28\"\n          fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9baaa6\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"83\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7d8a80\" letter-spacing=\"1\">문장 위에 칠해 보는 주목</text>\n    <g id=\"words\"></g>\n    <text x=\"83\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#76877e\">주목 비중은 정답 확률이 아니에요.</text>\n  </svg>\n</main>\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"guide\">문장의 단어를 눌러 보세요 · 키보드로도 고를 수 있어요</div>\n  <div class=\"meaning\" id=\"meaning\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></div>\n</footer>\n</article>\n<script>\nconst state = {\n  figure: 1,\n  selected: 4,\n  words: ['민지는', '컵을', '들고', '물을', '마셨다'],\n  weights: [\n    [12, 8, 12, 10, 58],\n    [10, 12, 44, 26, 8],\n    [20, 52, 8, 8, 12],\n    [8, 16, 6, 10, 60],\n    [12, 20, 8, 54, 6]\n  ]\n};\nfunction calculate(s) {\n  const row = s.weights[s.selected];\n  const total = row.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0);\n  const shares = row.map(n => Math.round(n / total * 100));\n  const peak = Math.max(...shares);\n  const target = shares.indexOf(peak);\n  return {\n    figure: '그림 ' + s.figure,\n    peak: peak + '%',\n    query: s.words[s.selected],\n    target: s.words[target],\n    items: s.words.map((word, i) => ({\n      word, index:i, x:122+i*111,\n      chosen:i===s.selected,\n      share:shares[i]+'%',\n      opacity:.08+.82*(shares[i]/100),\n      width:72*(shares[i]/100)\n    }))\n  };\n}\nconst ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\nconst wordLayer=document.getElementById('words');\nfunction el(tag,attrs,text){\n  const node=document.createElementNS(ns,tag);\n  Object.entries(attrs).forEach(([key,value])=>node.setAttribute(key,value));\n  if(text!==undefined)node.textContent=text;\n  return node;\n}\nconst nodes=state.words.map((word,i)=>{\n  const g=el('g',{'class':'word',role:'button',tabindex:'0'});\n  const chosen=el('text',{y:104,'text-anchor':'middle',class:'chosen'});\n  const selection=el('rect',{y:113,width:94,height:48,rx:10,class:'selection'});\n  const highlight=el('path',{'stroke':'#27a483','stroke-width':25,'stroke-linecap':'round',fill:'none'});\n  const label=el('text',{y:145,'text-anchor':'middle',class:'ink'},word);\n  const track=el('rect',{y:181,width:72,height:4,rx:2,fill:'#e7eee8'});\n  const bar=el('rect',{y:181,height:4,rx:2,fill:'#36a58b'});\n  const weight=el('text',{y:208,'text-anchor':'middle',class:'weight'});\n  g.append(selection,highlight,label,chosen,track,bar,weight);\n  g.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(i));\n  g.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n    if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();choose(i);}\n    if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='ArrowLeft'){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const next=(i+(e.key==='ArrowRight'?1:-1)+state.words.length)%state.words.length;\n      choose(next);\n      nodes[next].g.focus();\n    }\n  });\n  wordLayer.append(g);\n  return {g,chosen,selection,highlight,label,track,bar,weight};\n});\nfunction choose(index){\n  state.selected=index;\n  render();\n}\nfunction render(){\n  const view=calculate(state);\n  document.getElementById('figure').textContent=view.figure;\n  document.getElementById('peak').textContent=view.peak;\n  const meaning=document.getElementById('meaning');\n  meaning.replaceChildren(\n    document.createTextNode('‘'+view.query+'’는 '),\n    Object.assign(document.createElement('strong'),{textContent:'‘'+view.target+'’'}),\n    document.createTextNode('에 가장 주목해요.')\n  );\n  view.items.forEach((item,i)=>{\n    const n=nodes[i];\n    n.g.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item.chosen));\n    n.g.setAttribute('aria-label',item.word+', 주목 비중 '+item.share+', 예시 값');\n    n.selection.setAttribute('x',item.x-47);\n    n.highlight.setAttribute('d','M '+(item.x-30)+' 143 H '+(item.x+30));\n    n.highlight.setAttribute('stroke-opacity',item.opacity);\n    n.label.setAttribute('x',item.x);\n    n.chosen.setAttribute('x',item.x);\n    n.chosen.textContent=item.chosen?'고른 단어':'';\n    n.track.setAttribute('x',item.x-36);\n    n.bar.setAttribute('x',item.x-36);\n    n.bar.setAttribute('width',item.width);\n    n.weight.setAttribute('x',item.x);\n    n.weight.textContent=item.share;\n  });\n}\nrender();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "card_model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
   }
  },
